X:1
T:O For A Thousand Tongues
T:AZMON
C:Music: Carl G. Gläser, 1828 · Words: Charles Wesley, 1740
S:Open Hymnal Project ABC (openhymnal.org; marked public domain), melody line with every stanza as printed there; their source: "The Methodist Hymnal", 1905. Hymn 1.. Melody cross-checked against the hymnary.org score (hymnary.org/tune/azmon_glaser): 100% of pitches and 100% of note lengths agree.
